{"id":"665362","name":"荆芥炒凉粉","author":"给宝贝做的饭","authorId":"1900992","desc":"","cover":"images/665362/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"凉粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"荆芥","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"凉粉切成方丁。","img":"images/665362/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中加入少许底油，下入多一点的蒜片、干辣椒炒出香味。","img":"images/665362/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入少许水，下入凉粉转小火。","img":"images/665362/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入盐、味精、老抽定好味。把凉粉煨至透明。","img":"images/665362/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅前淋点香油。","img":"images/665362/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"最后下入荆芥，关火，翻炒均匀即可。","img":"images/665362/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665362/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665362/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}